    "type": "game",
    "name": "Rough Souls: Adventures",
    "steam_appid": 2591470,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf92 Adventure Mode \u2013 Explore, Interact, Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Adventure Mode, you freely roam a handcrafted world filled with interactive elements and hidden areas. You can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick up, throw, and eat items</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump and climb across the environment</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tame and ride animals like the Saiga Antelope</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate ships and reach new locations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk to NPCs to receive quests</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key locations include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>quest-giving NPC</strong> near the start</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>parkour section</strong> with falling barrels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>port area</strong> where you can buy your own ship after earning gold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mini-challenge zone with taming and exploration opportunities</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc80 Souls Mode \u2013 One Boss, Classic Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is one <strong>Souls-style boss encounter</strong> in the game, accessible early on via a quest from an NPC. This mode features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single, challenging boss</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emphasis on dodging, learning patterns, and punishing mistakes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A standalone experience inspired by soulslike mechanics</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Rough Mode \u2013 Precision Combat Arena</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible from the port area, <strong>Rough Mode</strong> is a directional 1v1 combat arena where you fight powerful mini-bosses using a custom mouse-driven parry and attack system.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Change attack and parry direction with your mouse</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight enemies with unique abilities</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn gold by defeating Rough bosses</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy your ship after winning and collecting enough gold</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udded Final Act \u2013 Sail, Survive, Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After purchasing your ship, you\u2019ll sail into an <strong>ice basin</strong>, where you\u2019re attacked by <strong>three marine monsters</strong>: a giant snake, kraken, and anglerfish. You must:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect explosives</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive multi-enemy encounters</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape the frozen trap</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This leads to a descent into a glowing <strong>underground crystal city</strong>, where you face <strong>five additional Rough bosses</strong>. Once they\u2019re defeated, a <strong>dragon captures you</strong>, marking the end of the game (until future updates).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 distinct game modes: Adventure, Souls, and Rough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Directional combat system with mouse-driven attack/parry mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short but varied gameplay (1.5\u20132 hours of content)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parkour sections, exploration, naval travel, and animal taming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built entirely in the Godot Engine by a solo developer</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf92 Adventure Mode \u2013 Explore, Interact, Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Adventure Mode, you freely roam a handcrafted world filled with interactive elements and hidden areas. You can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick up, throw, and eat items</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump and climb across the environment</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tame and ride animals like the Saiga Antelope</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate ships and reach new locations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk to NPCs to receive quests</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key locations include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>quest-giving NPC</strong> near the start</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>parkour section</strong> with falling barrels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>port area</strong> where you can buy your own ship after earning gold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mini-challenge zone with taming and exploration opportunities</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc80 Souls Mode \u2013 One Boss, Classic Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is one <strong>Souls-style boss encounter</strong> in the game, accessible early on via a quest from an NPC. This mode features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single, challenging boss</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emphasis on dodging, learning patterns, and punishing mistakes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A standalone experience inspired by soulslike mechanics</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Rough Mode \u2013 Precision Combat Arena</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible from the port area, <strong>Rough Mode</strong> is a directional 1v1 combat arena where you fight powerful mini-bosses using a custom mouse-driven parry and attack system.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Change attack and parry direction with your mouse</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight enemies with unique abilities</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn gold by defeating Rough bosses</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy your ship after winning and collecting enough gold</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udded Final Act \u2013 Sail, Survive, Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After purchasing your ship, you\u2019ll sail into an <strong>ice basin</strong>, where you\u2019re attacked by <strong>three marine monsters</strong>: a giant snake, kraken, and anglerfish. You must:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect explosives</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive multi-enemy encounters</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape the frozen trap</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This leads to a descent into a glowing <strong>underground crystal city</strong>, where you face <strong>five additional Rough bosses</strong>. Once they\u2019re defeated, a <strong>dragon captures you</strong>, marking the end of the game (until future updates).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 distinct game modes: Adventure, Souls, and Rough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Directional combat system with mouse-driven attack/parry mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short but varied gameplay (1.5\u20132 hours of content)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parkour sections, exploration, naval travel, and animal taming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built entirely in the Godot Engine by a solo developer</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Explore, fight, and sail in this short action-adventure! Tame animals, duel mini-bosses in directional combat, survive soulslike challenges, and battle sea monsters\u2014all handcrafted in Godot by a solo dev. Rough Souls is weird, fast, and brutally fun.",
